# Contact Form Endpoint Configuration
# To use Formspree:
# 1. Sign up at https://formspree.io (free)
# 2. Create a form pointing to adfleshner@gmail.com
# 3. Paste your Formspree endpoint URL here:
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID

# Or if using Web3Forms:
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=YOUR_ACCESS_KEY

